{{- /*
model.door.induce — the map a check about a failure state needs.

Rendered into the harness generator's fields region. A map rather than a
single function because the states differ: a check about a closed
instance and one about a failed instance both have to get there first,
and each names the state it wants by its error.
*/ -}}
{{- define "model.door.induce" -}}
	// Induce maps each error to a function that puts your implementation
	// into the state that error describes.
	//
	// A check that asks what happens after a particular error has to be
	// able to cause that error first. Map the error to a function that
	// provokes it, and the checks that need it can run.
	Induce {{ renderExpr (external .Vocab "Inductions") }}[T]
{{- end -}}
